<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησι-αστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία, ἐ. πίναξ</span> register
				<i>of voters,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				44.35
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐ. ψῆφοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cor.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ.</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργύριον</span>] <i>pay received for sitting
				in the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησία</span> at Athens and elsewhere,
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				51
			</span></i> (also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθὸς ἐκκλησιαστικός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, etc.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Michel</u>
				466
			</span></i>(Iasos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1272
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clerical,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cat.Cod.Astr.
				7.216
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.2.17.4
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Just.
					<u>Nov.</u>
					83.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
